commit 6d1af6972d8104822d58e6e88f0fd1f63ecf382b
Author: Steven Bacio <steven.buss@gmail.com>
Date:   Tue Nov 17 11:31:20 2026 -0800

    textnet word heads: no hand-set constants in the word loss (the controller's rulings): the terms added by learned log-variances (Kendall, Gal & Cipolla 2018, WordLoss, kept and saved), the core's cross-entropy balanced by the inverse of each class's weight in the batch (no mining), the tags classified among the crop's word means and the background by a softmax with a learned temperature (no margins); geo_known in crop_targets(words=True) (the IoU reads core x known x geo_known, the direction core x known), which words reach a held-out area found once per sheet; GEO_UNIT and the clamp documented as parameterisation and guard; a fixed-value test of word_loss
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
    Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UjTgrnx2j4PhzZErrad25Q
